        "name": {
          "zh": "红四方面军二次北上（名山—宝兴—丹巴—道孚—炉霍—甘孜）",
          "en": "Fourth Front Army second northward move (Mingshan–Baoxing–Danba–Daofu–Luhuo–Ganzi)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "红四方面军由天全、芦山、宝兴经懋功、丹巴西进，翻越党岭山夏羌涅阿垭口，经道孚、炉霍进抵甘孜。路线为示意，待按行军日志细化。",
          "en": "The Fourth Front Army moved west from Tianquan, Lushan, and Baoxing via Maogong and Danba, crossed the Xiaqiangniea Pass of Dangling Mountain, and advanced through Daofu and Luhuo to Garzê. The route is schematic and awaits refinement from march logs."
        },
